      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. i'll try the ice and elevating it. i just feel like going to a doctor for something that probably just needs rest is overkill, you know? i'm pretty sure it's just a cramp from being stuck in that seat for so long. if i take a decent amount of ibuprofen like 800mg every few hours, that should be fine to keep the swelling down and help me sleep, right? i really just want to sleep this off.",
